"evaluating function and jacobian for p = 0.22236059911277223,   loss = "
"2.5627985467376454e-07, grad = 0.0035066000930420284\n"
"evaluating function and jacobian for p = 0.22222008304298907,   loss = "
"7.758859239380127e-09, grad = 2.935984691530423e-05\n"
